requirement:
1、电气工程或计算机工程本科学历，或具备同等实践经验；
2、5年以上ASIC/SoC设计物理验证（DRC/LVS/ERC）经验；
3、具备业界主流PV工具的实际操作经验（如Mentor Calibre、Synopsys IC Validator）；
4、具有从PDK启用到流片的PV Sign-off流程经验；
5、具有与晶圆代工厂和EDA厂商合作开展规则文件建立与问题解决的经验。

加分项
1、具有7nm/5nm/3nm/2nm或其他先进制程节点经验；
2、具有早期PDK建立及不成熟规则文件验证经验；
3、具有先进封装相关PV验证经验；
4、具有PV方法学开发经验，包括豁免与回归框架。

1.BS degree in Electrical Engineering, Computer Engineering, or equivalent practical experience;
2.5+ years of experience in physical verification (DRC/LVS/ERC) for ASIC/SoC designs;
3.Hands-on experience with industry-standard PV tools (e.g., Mentor Calibre, Synopsys IC Validator);
4.Experience with PV signoff flow from PDK enablement through tapeout;
5. Experience working with Foundry and EDA vendors on rule-deck bring-up and issue resolution.

Preferred Qualifications
1.Experience with 7nm/5nm/3nm/2nm or other advanced nodes;
2.Experience with early PDK bring-up and immature rule-deck validation;
3.Experience with advanced package related PV verification;
4.Experience developing PV methodology, including waiver and regression frameworks.

description:
团队介绍：芯片平台是一个覆盖从逻辑综合到芯片投片、封装设计与仿真、回片测试、量产全流程的统一化芯片设计平台，提供支持多工艺、多项目的自动化设计流程及设计服务。平台整体划分为硅前、硅后、基础资源管理、IP 定制四大业务板块。
通过硅前 - 硅后全流程覆盖、IP 自主定制、基础资源统一管理的架构，芯片平台实现了从 RTL 到量产的端到端设计能力，支持多晶圆厂、多工艺节点，持续通过自动化提效与质量保障，为公司业务提供坚实的支撑。

1、负责先进制程节点ASIC/SoC设计（包括先进封装）的电源完整性（PI）Sign-off，涵盖静态IR压降、动态IR压降、电迁移（EM）、电源网格分析、浪涌电流、上电/掉电分析、负载阶跃/瞬态分析，以及封装/板级/PDN协同分析，主导从早期设计到流片的全芯片及模块级电源完整性分析，包括供电网络建模、电源域分析、无向量和基于向量的仿真，以及PI Sign-off方法学与收敛；
2、推动早期PI方法学和流程建立，尤其面向新制程节点、早期PDK、不成熟工艺文件及新型电源架构，分析并调试复杂PI结果，包括静态/动态IR热点、EM违规、电流尖峰、电源网格连接问题、电源开关行为、封装引起的电压噪声、去耦电容效果、LDO/VRM响应，以及负载阶跃/上电瞬态行为；
3、与物理设计、RTL/设计、电源架构、封装、模拟/PMIC、库、晶圆代工厂及EDA团队紧密合作，解决PI问题并完成Sign-off收敛；
4、就PI相关问题担任与晶圆代工厂及EDA厂商的技术接口，包括工艺/规则解释、EM/IR规则要求、金属叠层与电阻假设、封装模型相关性及工具差异解决；
5、制定并优化先进制程节点设计的PI方法学，包括基于向量/无向量分析、开关活动生成与覆盖率、静态/动态IR分析、EM分析、上电/电压爬升分析、负载阶跃分析、电源开关分析及封装感知分析；
6、建立PI Sign-off标准、方法学和最佳实践，并为同事提供技术指导。

1.Own and drive Physical Verification (PV) signoff for advanced-node ASIC/SoC designs, including DRC/LVS/ERC/ANT, fill program, ESD PERC/Reliability checks, GDS scramble, and advanced package related verification;
2.Own the complete PV flow from early PDK test/enablement through final tapeout, including PV methodology development, flow bring-up, debugging, and signoff closure;
3.Drive early PDK and rule-deck bring-up and validation. For immature or early-release PDKs/verification decks: analyze PV results, identify root cause (design/PDK/rule deck/technology file/tool), develop focused test cases, and work with Foundry and EDA vendors to drive closure;
4.Perform in-depth PV result analysis and debugging, including hierarchical/flat run monitoring, IP verification and SoC-level integration, regression analysis across rule-deck/PDK versions, and PV-PR correlation;
5.Act as the technical interface between the company and Foundry/PDK teams/EDA vendors, including issue reporting and tracking, test case preparation, rule interpretation discussion, and rule-deck fix validation;
6.Develop and maintain PV signoff methodology, including checklists, run strategies, waiver methodology, regression methodology, and signoff criteria.

requirement:
1、电气工程或计算机工程本科学历，或具备同等实践经验；
2、5年以上ASIC/SoC设计电源完整性分析经验；
3、具备业界主流PI工具的实际操作经验（如Ansys RedHawk-SC、Synopsys PT-PX、Cadence Voltus）；
4、具有静态和动态IR压降分析、EM分析及电源网格分析经验；
5、具有从早期设计到流片的PI Sign-off流程经验。

优先任职要求：
1、具有7nm/5nm/3nm/2nm或其他先进制程节点经验；
2、具有先进封装PI协同分析（封装/板级/PDN）经验；
3、具有面向新制程节点的早期PI方法学建立经验；
4、具有与晶圆代工厂和EDA厂商合作开展PI规则解释及工具相关性分析的经验。

1.BS degree in Electrical Engineering,Computer Engineering,or equivalent practical experience;
2.5+years of experience in power integrity analysis for ASIC/SoC designs;
3.Hands-on experience with industry-standard PI Tools(e.g.,Ansys RedHawk-SC,Synopsys PT-PX,Cadence Voltus);
4.Experience with static and dynamic IR drop analysis,EM analysis,and power grid analysis;
5.Experience with PI signoff flow from early design through tapeout.

Preferred Qualification(s)
1.Experience with7nm/5nm/3nm/2nm or other advanced nodes;
2.Experience with advanced package PI co-analysis(package/board/PDN);
3.Experience with early-stage PI methodology bring-up for new process nodes;
4.Experience working with Foundry and EDA vendors on PI rule interpretation and Tool correlation.

description:
团队介绍：芯片平台是一个覆盖从逻辑综合到芯片投片、封装设计与仿真、回片测试、量产全流程的统一化芯片设计平台，提供支持多工艺、多项目的自动化设计流程及设计服务。平台整体划分为硅前、硅后、基础资源管理、IP 定制四大业务板块。
通过硅前 - 硅后全流程覆盖、IP 自主定制、基础资源统一管理的架构，芯片平台实现了从 RTL 到量产的端到端设计能力，支持多晶圆厂、多工艺节点，持续通过自动化提效与质量保障，为公司业务提供坚实的支撑。

1、针对架构和RTL开展逻辑综合与设计优化；
2、编制和调优时序约束（SDC），开展层次化/全芯片STA Sign-off与时序收敛；
3、实现低功耗设计技术与约束（UPF、时钟门控、电源门控、动态电压调节）；
4、使用形式验证工具（Conformal、Formality）开展形式验证与等价性检查；
5、与前端工程师合作开展架构探索与规划；
6、与后端工程师合作开展布图规划、布局布线（P&R）、拥塞分析和时序瓶颈分析。


1.Perform logic synthesis and design optimization for architectures and RTLs;
2.Timing constrains (SDC) preparation and tuning, and conduct hierarchical/full-chip STA sign off and timing closure;
3.Implement low-power design techniques and constraints (UPF, clock gating, power gating, dynamic voltage scaling);
4.Formal verification & equivalence checking using formal verification tools (Conformal, Formality);
5.Work with front-end engineers for architectural exploration and planning;
6.Work with backend engineers on floor planning, place & route (P&R), congestion analysis, and timing bottlenecks.

团队介绍：芯片平台是一个覆盖从逻辑综合到芯片投片、封装设计与仿真、回片测试、量产全流程的统一化芯片设计平台，提供支持多工艺、多项目的自动化设计流程及设计服务。平台整体划分为硅前、硅后、基础资源管理、IP 定制四大业务板块。
通过硅前 - 硅后全流程覆盖、IP 自主定制、基础资源统一管理的架构，芯片平台实现了从 RTL 到量产的端到端设计能力，支持多晶圆厂、多工艺节点，持续通过自动化提效与质量保障，为公司业务提供坚实的支撑。

1、工艺整合管理：作为内部团队与委外封测厂（OSAT）、晶圆厂及基板供应商之间的唯一接口，解决2D/2.5D/3D封装项目的工艺相关问题；
2、项目执行与风险控制：跟进供应商以满足工艺要求，介入并推动问题解决，确保生产流程顺畅；
3、研发预研：面向先进研发项目，主导工艺研究，推动供应商满足技术要求，并对新型封装技术开展预验证；
4、跨团队协作：与封装设计、热/应力仿真及产品团队协调，统一工艺约束，解决跨领域技术问题。

1.Process Integration Management : Serve as the sole interface between internal teams and OSATs, fabs, and substrate vendors to resolve process-related issues for 2D/2.5D/3D packaging projects;
2.Project Execution & Risk Control : Follow up with suppliers to meet process requirements, intervene in problem-solving, and ensure smooth production flow;
3.R&D Pre-research : For advanced R&D projects, lead process research, drive vendors to meet technical requirements, and conduct pre-verification of new packaging technologies;
4.Cross-team Collaboration : Coordinate with packaging design, thermal/stress simulation, and product teams to align process constraints and resolve cross-domain technical issues.

requirement:
1、微电子、电子、材料科学、机械工程或相关专业硕士学位及以上，至少2年半导体封装工艺相关工作经验；
2、具备经实践验证的2D/2.5D/3D封装工艺整合经验，并至少具备FCBGA、FCCSP、MCM、2.5D、3D中一种封装技术的实际操作经验；
3、熟悉封装工艺流程和工艺设计规则（DRM）；
4、精通工艺问题解决方法，具有主导封装工艺失效根因分析和纠正措施实施的经验；
5、具备出色的跨团队沟通能力。

优先任职要求：
1、具有2.5D或3D封装（TSV键合、3D堆叠）项目的量产工艺整合经验；
2、具有先进封装技术的工艺优化经验；
3、熟悉封装可靠性验证标准及热/应力仿真基础知识。

Minimum Qualification(s)
1.Master's degree or above in Microelectronics,Electronics,Materials Science,Mechanical Engineering,or related fields,with at least2years of relevant work experience;
2.Proven experience in2D/2.5D/3D packaging process integration,with hands-on experience in at least one of the following packaging technologies:FCBGA,FCCSP,MCM,2.5D,3D;
3.Familiar with packaging process flow,process design rules(DRM);
4.Proficient in process problem-solving methodologies,with experience in leading root cause analysis and corrective action implementation for packaging process failures;
5.Strong cross-team communication Skills.

Preferred Qualification(s)
1.Experience in mass production process integration for2.5D or3D packaging(TSV bonding,3D stacking)projects;
2.Experience in process optimization for advanced packaging technologies;
3.Familiar with packaging reliability verification standards and thermal/stress simulation basics.

description:
团队介绍：为字节业务量体裁衣，提供最优化的数据中心芯片解决方案，愿景是成为业界领先的服务器芯片开发团队，助力公司在存储、网络、服务器等业务提升性能、降低成本。

1、基于产品需求，参与SoC系统架构设计，构建SoC分析与评估框架；
2、根据系统性能、功耗和成本要求，设计并优化SoC芯片架构，负责IP选型，以及RAS、DFX、子系统和低功耗方案的制定与设计；
3、针对典型应用场景和基准测试，分析系统性能瓶颈并提出改进方案；
4、与芯片设计和验证团队协作，开展SoC性能测试与优化；
5、推动关键技术突破，与上下游团队开展方案研究、可行性分析以及算法与硬件架构探索；
6、持续跟踪行业技术趋势，识别有价值的核心技术点和技术方向，参与系统级STCO（系统技术协同优化），从封装和系统层面规划芯片方案与技术路线图。


1.Based on product requirements, participate in SoC system architecture design and build SoC analysis and evaluation frameworks;
2.Design and optimize SoC chip architecture according to system performance, power, and cost requirements; responsible for IP selection, as well as the formulation and design of RAS, DFX, subsystem, and low-power solutions;
3.Analyze system performance bottlenecks for typical application scenarios and benchmarks, and propose improvement solutions;
4.Collaborate with chip design and verification teams to conduct SoC performance testing and optimization;
5.Drive key technology breakthroughs; work with upstream and downstream teams on solution research, feasibility studies, and exploration of algorithms and hardware architectures;
6.Continuously track industry technology trends and identify valuable core technology points and technical directions;Participate in system-level STCO (System Technology Co-Optimization), planning chip solutions and technology roadmaps from packaging and system-level perspectives.

requirement:
1、微电子、集成电路、电子工程或相关专业学士及以上学历，硕士学位或博士学位优先；
2、5年以上SoC研发经验；
3、熟悉CPU架构，深入理解操作系统、系统软件以及芯片架构与设计；
4、具备前瞻性思维，能够推动产品创新；
5、能够独立开展芯片PPA（功耗、性能、面积）分析；
6、具有服务器SoC架构经验，了解先进制程节点和先进封装技术（2.5D、3D、CoWoS、EMIB），以及系统级封装技术（晶圆级、SOIC）。

1.Bachelor's degree or above in Microelectronics,Integrated Circuits,Electronic Engineering,or a related field;Master's or PhD preferred;
2.5+years of SoC R&D experience;
3.Familiar with CPU architecture,with in-depth knowledge of OS,system software,and chip architecture and design;
4.Forward-thinking mindset with the ability to drive product innovation;
5.Capable of independently conducting chip PPA(Power,Performance,Area)analysis;
6.Experience in server SoC architecture,knowledge of advanced process nodes and advanced packaging technologies(2.5D,3D,CoWoS,EMIB),as well as system-level packaging(Wafer-scale,SOIC).

description:
1、拓展并孵化商家，助力类目增长；
2、探索契合商家短期与长期发展规划的创新合作模式，高效精准地投入平台资源；
3、与跨职能团队紧密协作，解决业务增长中的核心难题；
4、以专业咨询的方式，为所有商家提供战略规划、运营、达人/联盟/代理商合作、商品营销及物流解决方案；
5、向商家同步平台产品更新及最新营销活动机会。

1.Acquire and incubate merchants to support category growth;
2.Discover innovative collaborative models that align to the merchant's short-term and long-term development plans, and invest platform resources effectively and efficiently;
3.Solve key challenges in business growth by strong collaboration with cross-functional teams;
4.Employ a consultative approach by offering strategic content, operations, creator/affiliate/agency partner, merchandising, and logistics solutions to all sellers;
5.Update sellers on TikTok Shop product developments and new promotional opportunities.

requirement:
1、有达成并超额完成销售额、GMV或其他商业目标的成功案例；
2、出色的人际沟通与商务谈判能力；
3、具备良好的团队协作精神，学习能力强，能适应变化；
4、中英双语流利。

加分项
1、熟悉TikTok及其他内容平台，有内容电商相关经验者优先；
2、拥有品牌及经销商资源者优先；
3、2年及以上电商从业经验，同时具备平台方与品牌/商家方双重经验者优先。

1.Track record of delivering & exceeding sales, GMV, or other commercial goals;
2.Excellent interpersonal and negotiation skills;
3.A good team player, a fast learner, and open to changes;
4.Bilingual (English & Mandarin).

Preferred Qualifications
1.Familiar with TikTok and other content platforms; experience in content-based e-commerce is highly preferred;
2.Strong connections with brands and distributors are preferred;
3.2+ years experience in e-commerce business with mixed experience in both platform side and brand/merchant side is highly preferred.

description:
1、经营分析：持续监控直播流量、开播率、直播时长、观看规模、转化率、商家及创作者活跃度等核心指标，能够自主开展业务复盘，定位问题并形成可执行的优化方案；
2、产品研究：持续洞察英国电商、内容平台及直播电商市场的发展，研究重点平台，识别可应用于TikTok Shop的增长机会和最佳实践；
3、预算管理：跟踪并评估直播业务预算使用效率，评估预算对流量、GMV以及商家/创作者参与度带来的影响，协同财务、运营、品类团队优化资金投放，保障长期投入效率；
4、增长策略：设计策略框架，完成直播生态内商家和创作者的引入、孵化与规模化成长；搭建分层模型、激励机制与项目规范，支撑业务持续增长。

1.Business performance analysis: Continuously monitor key metrics, including LIVE traffic, go-live rate, streaming hours, viewership, conversion rate, and merchant and creator activity; Independently conduct business reviews, identify issues, and develop actionable optimization plans;
2.Competitive and market research: Track developments across UK e-commerce, content platforms, and the LIVE commerce market; Analyze priority competitors and identify growth opportunities and best practices that can be applied to TikTok Shop;
3.Budget management: Track and assess the efficiency of LIVE business spending and evaluate its impact on traffic, GMV, and merchant and creator participation; Partner with Finance, Operations, and Category teams to optimize investment allocation and ensure sustainable returns over the long term;
4.Growth strategy: Design strategic frameworks to onboard, incubate, and scale merchants and creators within the LIVE ecosystem; Build segmentation models, incentive mechanisms, and program standards that support sustained business growth.

requirement:
1、中英双语，能够与中国团队进行深入业务沟通，同时能在全英文环境中开展会议、汇报及书面沟通；
2、本科及以上学历，市场营销、商业管理、经济学、统计学、传播学或其他相关专业；
3、4年及以上电商、直播、内容平台、用户运营或商业运营相关经验，有成功项目落地案例；
4、能够对数据进行解读及分析，有数据敏感度，能够将数据转化为明确的业务决策依据；
5、能够熟练使用AI工具提升研究、分析、内容生产、信息整理及项目管理效率；
6、有海外电商平台工作经验、海外零售行业工作经验为加分项；有用户增长、资源管理相关项目的成功经验为加分项。

1.Language proficiency: Proficient in Chinese, with the ability to engage in in-depth business discussions with stakeholders in China; professional working proficiency in English, with the ability to lead meetings, deliver presentations, and communicate effectively in writing in an English-speaking environment;
2.Education: Bachelor’s degree or above in Marketing, Business Administration, Economics, Statistics, Communications, or a related field;
3.Relevant experience: At least four years of experience in e-commerce, LIVE streaming, content platforms, user operations, or business operations, with a proven track record of successfully delivering projects;
4.Analytical skills: Strong ability to interpret and analyze data, identify meaningful patterns, and translate insights into clear business decisions;
5.AI proficiency: Demonstrated ability to use AI tools effectively to improve efficiency in research, analysis, content creation, information management, and project management;
6.Experience working for an international e-commerce platform or in an overseas retail market is a plus; Proven success in user growth or resource management initiatives is a plus.

description:
1、拟定并实施内部审计计划，确保全面风险评估，以覆盖所有关键财务报告流程和管控；
2、主导审计工作从计划到发布最终审计报告的全流程，确保整个审计过程符合专业标准；
3、对测试中发现的问题提出科学的整改建议，并督促业务部门彻底改进； 
4、为公司管理提供详细的审计报告，评估与审计结果相关的风险并进行风险分级；
5、复盘团队审计工作，提供培训、指导和反馈，提升团队成员的技能与能力；
6、完成与公司各业务部门、监督机构以及外部审计等协同方的协调与沟通工作。

1.Develop and implement audit plans focused on internal controls over financial reporting, ensuring thorough risk assessments and comprehensive coverage of all key financial reporting processes and controls;
2.Lead all phases of audits, from planning to the publication of the final audit report, ensuring compliance with professional standards throughout the audit process;
3.Identify the root causes of audit observations and provide actionable recommendations to mitigate associated risks. Track all issues and remediation efforts until they are successfully resolved and the underlying root causes are fully addressed;
4.Quantify materiality and assess risks related to audit findings, preparing detailed audit reports for management;
